sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant GW as GatewayRuntimeService
  participant B as RocketMQ broker
  participant EB as EventBusRelayWorker (NEW)
  participant RT as TestAgentRuntime / external runtime
  participant CON as Gateway response consumer
  C->>GW: POST /a2a (controller, NEW)
  GW->>B: produce T_invocation_req (hop1)
  B->>EB: poll T_invocation_req (NEW consumer)
  EB->>EB: GOVERNANCE: inbox dedup + tenant + corr + audit
  EB->>B: produce T_invocation_deliver (hop2, NEW — was unused)
  B->>RT: poll T_invocation_deliver
  RT->>RT: serve → produce response
  RT->>B: produce T_invocation_resp_in (resp hop1)
  B->>EB: poll T_invocation_resp_in (NEW)
  EB->>EB: GOVERNANCE: dedup + corr + audit
  EB->>B: produce T_invocation_resp_out (resp hop2, NEW)
  B->>CON: poll T_invocation_resp_out
  CON-->>GW: classify
  GW-->>C: IngressResponse
  Note over EB: relay governance now EXERCISED end-to-end (as-is: zero coverage)
